  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The use of performing arts in environmental education to improve Amur tiger conservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to raise peoples awareness, about the state of the Amur tiger population with the use of the performing art by, (1) holding drama lessons on ecological topics for school children, agencies, NGOs, (2) staging theatrical performances devoted to Amur tiger conservation issues both in the cities and villages, (3) holding a workshop on the use of performing arts in environmental education for educators and teachers, and, (4) providing ecological theater with stage supplies and costumes.</narrative>
  </description>
